sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Gateway
  participant PreviewStore
  participant Importer
  participant SQLite
  Browser->>Gateway: Upload bounded workout file
  Gateway->>Importer: Parse and validate bytes
  Importer-->>Gateway: Normalized definition and warnings
  Gateway->>PreviewStore: Store bytes and hash for 15 minutes
  Gateway-->>Browser: Preview ID, steps, duration, warnings
  Browser->>Gateway: Confirm preview with operation ID
  Gateway->>PreviewStore: Reopen original bytes
  Gateway->>Importer: Reparse and verify hash
  Gateway->>SQLite: Commit workout, revision, audit, receipt
  SQLite-->>Gateway: Existing or created outcome
  Gateway-->>Browser: Idempotent confirmation result
